<title>USA: US INDUSTRIES COMPLETES ODYSSEY SPORTS SALE.</title>
<headline>US INDUSTRIES COMPLETES ODYSSEY SPORTS SALE.</headline>
<dateline>ISELIN, N.J. 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>US Industries Inc said Monday it completed the sale of Odyssey Sports Inc to Callaway Golf Co for $130 million in cash.</p>
<p>When the company first announced the deal July 21, tt said it would net $80 million from selling the maker of golf putters, resulting in a after-tax gain of $50 million.</p>
